 was ravaged by nuclear fire, and it seemed humanity had been destroyed. Yet people survived, fighting bitterly over the last remnants of water and food. In this age ruled by violence, a lone man staggers across the wasteland, barely clinging to life.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11317419/screencap/69d91fd7867b6.jpg"},{"title":"A Better Tomorrow","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"106352","synopsis":"As Kenshiro, successor to Hokuto Shinken, travels the wasteland with Bat, they witness an old man being chased by a gang of armed thugs. The thugs are after the precious seed rice the old man is protecting. Ignoring Bat's warning, Kenshiro moves in to save him, but the gang's leader, Spade, fires a crossbow straight at Kenshiro!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674674/screencap/69d925c735899.jpg"},{"title":"Southern Cross","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"106507","synopsis":"Kenshiro and Bat arrive in Southern Cross, the stronghold of the King Army, infamous for its countless atrocities. Waiting for nightfall, they slip into the city, where they witness Club—one of King’s men— brutally tormenting innocent slaves. Confronted with this cruelty, Kenshiro unleashes the power of Hokuto Shinken!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674675/screencap/69e2fccdb9c60.jpg"},{"title":"Flames of Obsession","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"106512","synopsis":"Kenshiro finally reaches his long-standing nemesis: Shin, the successor to Nanto Koshuken and the man known as King. Fueled by the fire of revenge, Kenshiro suddenly finds himself facing Heart, one of Shin’s loyal henchmen. The massive Heart, known as the Destroyer of Fists, is protected by layers of thick fat that render Hokuto Shinken ineffective. Kenshiro is driven into a desperate, life threatening corner...but can he find a way to turn the tide!?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674676/screencap/69e2fcf989e2d.jpg"},{"title":"Bloody Cross","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"106657","synopsis":"Kenshiro burns with rage toward Shin, the man who stole his beloved fiancée Yuria. Shin is stunned by the transformation of the Kenshiro now standing before him. Realizing the battle is turning against him, Shin resorts to a terrifying act. At last, the long and bitter feud between Shin and Kenshiro nears its final reckoning!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674677/screencap/69ed5f5a1d1dc.jpg"},{"title":"God`s Land","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"106878","synopsis":"Rin is captured by the fanatical fighting group Golan.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674678/screencap/69f4df1f1d73b.jpg"},{"title":"The Ultimate Assassin","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"107098","synopsis":"Kenshiro goes solo into their headquarter, God's Land. There he encounters Mad Sarge, the brutal instructor who trains Golan's soldiers. Once a member of the elite Red Berets and famed for his deadly combat skills, Mad Sarge leads his troops in a fullforce assault on Kenshiro!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674679/screencap/69ff2630ed31b.jpg"},{"title":"Messenger from the Homeland","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"107436","synopsis":"While Kenshiro is at a bar, a group of rugged men appear and try to recruit him into their ranks. Kenshiro easily drives them off, but moments later, a grimy young boy walks into the bar. His name is Taki, a boy who once lived with Bat in a desolate village.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674680/screencap/6a0842aed796b.jpg"},{"title":"The Mad Dogs Must Die","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"107601","synopsis":"Toyo, a compassionate old woman, has taken in countless orphaned children and showers them with unconditional love. Kenshiro deeply respects her kindness, especially toward Bat and Rin, whom she treats no differently from the others. But after Kenshiro and his companions leave the village late at night, a terrible danger approaches.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674681/screencap/6a10a501110b7.jpg"},{"title":"Devil Rebirth","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"107760","synopsis":"Kenshiro burns with overwhelming fury at the monstrous cruelty Jackal inflicted on Toyo. Swearing he will have his revenge, he begins closing in on Jackal and his gang step by step. Driven into terror by Kenshiro's relentless pursuit, Jackal makes a desperate move-he frees \"Devil Rebirth,\" a demonic giant who had been imprisoned in a penitentiary.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674682/screencap/6a1bf5cd76b8d.jpg"},{"title":"A Man of Nanto","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"107903","synopsis":"A woman appears before him: Mamiya, who bears a striking resemblance to his lost love, Yuria. Meanwhile, outside the village, a beautiful man-so striking he could be mistaken for a woman-roams the wasteland in search of the man marked with seven scars on his chest!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674683/screencap/6a23d0ab0057f.jpg"},{"title":"Men Who Saw Her Tears","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"108016","synopsis":"Koh's life is taken by the Fang Clan, yet Mamiya stands firm before the villagers. But when she is alone, away from prying eyes, she quietly weeps for her fallen younger brother. Kenshiro and Rei set off in pursuit of the Fang Clan, who stole Koh's belongings as they fled...and now the fists of Hokuto and Nanto are about to explode!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11674684/screencap/6a2c3d983e5cc.jpg"},{"title":"A Bloody Trap","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"108166","synopsis":"Fang Clan Chieftain uses Airi, the sister Rei has been searching for, and takes her hostage, as leverage to bend Rei to his will. When Rei finally reunites with his sister after so long, he is devastated by how much she has changed and loses control of himself. Kenshiro tries desperately to calm Rei...but the situation spirals toward danger.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11841538/screencap/6a36b69de02fd.jpg"},{"title":"The One Who Laughs Last","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18190","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169228","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56646","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"295357","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"465216","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"108247","synopsis":"With Airi taken hostage, Rei is ordered by Fang Clan Chieftain to kill Kenshiro. Kenshiro urges him not to fall for Fang Clan Chieftain's manipulations, but Rei, desperate to protect the sister he cherishes above all else, takes a fighting stance against him. The clash between Kenshiro and Rei-Hokuto Shinken versus Nanto Suichoken-is about to erupt!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11852753/screencap/6a3fcdb59cc83.jpg"}]},{"id":7685,"path":"/anime/7685-victoria-of-many-faces","info":{"title":"Victoria of Many Faces","synopsis":"In un'epoca in cui gli agenti operano nell'ombra, Chloe del Regno di Hagur trascorre le sue giornate portando a termine con successo missione dopo missione, grazie alle sue impareggiabili doti di travestimento e alle abilità nelle arti marziali. Dopo il tradimento del suo superiore, decide però di cambiare completamente vita: Chloe sceglie di abbandonare il passato e rinascere come una semplice cittadina, con il nome di Victoria, nel vicino Regno di Ashberry, desiderosa di vivere finalmente un'esistenza normale e felice. Eppure, il suo primo giorno da \"Victoria\" prende subito una piega inaspettata: per una coincidenza diventa la tutrice di una bambina e inizia così a intrecciare legami con molte nuove persone. Ben presto, però, le ombre tornano ad avvicinarsi: uomini misteriosi si muovono all’ordine del Secondo Principe, mentre la minaccia di un’organizzazione nascosta torna a farsi sentire.","image":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/468049/backgrounds/68c4308426c89.jpg","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/season/28047/posters/64f78a9ada39c.jpg","logo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/468049/clearlogo/6a544e15b6cb1.png","background":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/468049/backgrounds/68c4308426c89.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dm8QPSlRYdI"],"imdbId":"","type":"series","tags":["TV","Terminato","Estate","2026"],"tagKeys":{"TV":"TV","Terminato":"Completed","Estate":"Summer"},"genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"rating":"8.0","studio":"Studio DEEN","episodesCount":9,"extra":{"ids":{"malId":62476,"anilistId":198709,"crunchyId":"GT00378126","disneyId":null,"netflixId":null,"primeId":null,"anilistIds":[198709],"malIds"